  DisplayName: Undersea Enthusiast
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Prerequisite Region - High Seas You love diving and exploring the
    world beneath the waves, and long periods of swimming have trained you to move
    easily through the water. You're also fascinated by undersea creatures and cultures-and
    may even have a trace of one of them in your own lineage. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Strength or Constitution , and one is a free attribute
    boost. You're trained in the Athletics skill and the Ocean Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Underwater Marauder] skill feat.
